.TH "libnvmf_config_conn_for_each" 9 "libnvmf_config_conn_for_each" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_config_conn_for_each \- iterate over the resolved connections.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvmf_config_conn_for_each
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_config *config "  ","
.BI "void (*callback)(const struct libnvmf_config_conn *conn, void *user_data) "  ","
.BI "void *user_data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "config" 12
the resolved configuration
.IP "callback" 12
called once per connection, in file order (main file first,
then the drop-ins in sorted order)
.IP "user_data" 12
caller context passed to \fIcallback\fP
